From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: KB <kb@kb-rpcs3.example>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 03:32:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] PS5: sample RSX FIFO and aggregate draw, DMA and Vulkan timings

Diagnostic-only instrumentation. Sample FIFO running/nonrunning loops
every 128 iterations, and aggregate CPU time/calls for vertex/index
preparation, DMA sync and Vulkan queue submit. Report PS5 PERF once
per watchdog window. No guest/graphics behaviour or game settings
changed. Timings overlap and do not represent GPU execution time.

---
